    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lynam Auctioneers are delighted to present 4 Beech Drive, a beautifully maintained three-bedroom family home in the heart of Dundrum. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive property benefits from a large private rear garden and is situated within a mature, well-established estate renowned for its strong sense of community and increasing appeal to young families.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1970s to a high standard, the accommodation is both spacious and versatile, catering to the needs of modern family living. Upon entering the property, the living room is located to the left of the entrance hall, while to the rear a comfortable family room overlooks the garden. The ground floor also features a dining room and kitchen with excellent potential for further enhancement.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generous bedrooms and a family bathroom. A particular feature of the property is the attached garage, offering significant scope for conversion or extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a substantial and unspoilt private garden, providing endless possibilities for extension, landscaping, or creating a wonderful outdoor living space.\r\n\r\nIdeally located off Barton Road, the property enjoys close proximity to Dundrum, Churchtown and Nutgrove, with an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities nearby. Recreational facilities are abundant, including Marlay Park, Meadowbrook Leisure Centre and Swimming Pool, together with numerous sporting clubs and facilities for all ages.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by a wide range of highly regarded primary and secondary schools. Public transport links are excellent, with the LUAS within walking distance and convenient access to the M50 and N11 road networks, making commuting straightforward.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a quality family home in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended. Please reply to the advert to arrange an appointment with our Sales Team."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Dundrum location – Situated in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential areas.\r\nExcellent condition throughout – A well-maintained family home ready for immediate occupation.\r\nThree generous bedrooms – Ideal for families, downsizers, or those working from home.\r\nLarge private rear garden – Offering privacy, outdoor space, and significant future potential.\r\nAttached garage – Excellent scope for conversion, extension, or additional accommodation (subject to planning).\r\nMature, family-friendly estate – A well-established neighbourhood with a strong community atmosphere.\r\nWalking distance to the LUAS – Providing excellent public transport access to the city centre and beyond.\r\nOutstanding local amenities – Close to Dundrum Town Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre, restaurants, cafés, and local shops.\r\nExcellent schools and recreational facilities nearby – Including parks, sports clubs, and leisure facilities such as Marlay Park and Meadowbrook Leisure Centre."
      },
      {
